%N A049309 Number of nonisomorphic self-complementary circulant digraphs (Cayley digraphs for the cyclic group) of order 2n-1.
%C A049309 There is an easy formula for prime orders. Formulae are also known for squarefree and prime-squared orders.
%C A049309 Further values for squarefree and prime-squared orders can be found in the Liskovets reference.
%H A049309 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A049309/b049309.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..50</a>
%H A049309 V. A. Liskovets, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0104131">Some identities for enumerators of circulant graphs</a>, arXiv:math/0104131 [math.CO], 2001.
%H A049309 V. A. Liskovets and R. Poeschel, <a href="https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/pdf/b76573e0c2df2ff117cef015809e232a3747f585">On the enumeration of circulant graphs of prime-power and squarefree orders</a>
